            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m04_l01_cpq06_p02_c03",
              "mark": "A1",
              "text": "Add sums of squares to obtain combined sum(x_comb^2) = 21468 + 23456 = 44924."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "part_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m04_l01_cpq06_p03",
          "marks": 3,
          "marking_points": [
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m04_l01_cpq06_p03_c01",
              "mark": "M1",
              "text": "Substitute into combined variance formula: 44924 / 20 - 46.8^2."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m04_l01_cpq06_p03_c02",
              "mark": "A1",
              "text": "Evaluate combined variance = 2246.2 - 2190.24 = 55.96 and combined standard deviation = sqrt(55.96) = 7.48 (3 s.f.)."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m04_l01_cpq06_p03_c03",
              "mark": "B1",
              "text": "Explain that the separation between the group means (42 vs 54) adds between-group spread to the pooled distribution."
            }
          ]
        }
